# Student records — a minor's academic, financial, and personal data. Never commit.
students/

# …except the conduct harness's SYNTHETIC planted students — fixtures, not people.
# Without these exceptions the privacy rule silently swallows the planted case
# workspaces and a fresh clone gets cases that test nothing (found 2026-08-17 by
# the Phase 3-5 independent review).
!college-apps/tests/conduct/cases/*/workspace/students/
!college-apps/tests/conduct/cases/*/workspace/students/**

.venv/
.cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# conduct harness outputs (transcripts, workspaces, verdicts)
college-apps/tests/conduct/results/
